:0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.beta7, 4.5.beta6\n- Not reproducible in 4.5.beta5 or 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta7 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6650 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21025.1024) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600KF (16 threads) - 31.82 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOutlined text rendered with an MSDF font has a blocky shadow beneath it when rendered at a small scale.\n\nExpected result (from 4.5.beta5)\n<img width=\"95\" height=\"47\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cf63bd6-ef1a-41d6-a9c0-cb9004d499c1\" />\n\nBugged result (from 4.5.beta7)\n<img width=\"83\" height=\"39\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f643531-33ff-4ba9-899a-d8a8b7bc67c4\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen project in 4.5.beta7, open `test_label.tscn`, then view at 300% zoom. The project has the default font set to use MSDF, and the label has its outline size set to 4.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[text-bug-replica.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22060671/text-bug-replica.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/priv